WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.316
AgentSaver

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.366
a Mac screen

00:00:02.178 --> 00:00:02.838
saver

00:00:03.366 --> 00:00:04.592
AgentSaver is a

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:07.292
$7.99 macOS screen

00:00:07.104 --> 00:00:08.189
saver that shows

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.108
running Claude Code

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:10.689
Codex and OpenCode

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.337
sessions on the

00:00:11.149 --> 00:00:11.950
lock screen

00:00:12.175 --> 00:00:13.566
streaming replies like

00:00:13.378 --> 00:00:14.710
lyrics and queueing

00:00:14.522 --> 00:00:15.358
agents like a

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:16.054
playlist

00:00:16.582 --> 00:00:18.056
Replies scroll across

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:18.704
the screen with

00:00:18.516 --> 00:00:19.518
the latest line

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:20.650
bright and earlier

00:00:20.462 --> 00:00:21.310
ones fading

00:00:21.499 --> 00:00:22.407
while the task

00:00:22.537 --> 00:00:23.751
its progress and

00:00:23.563 --> 00:00:24.683
the current command

00:00:24.495 --> 00:00:25.768
stay pinned below

00:00:26.016 --> 00:00:27.254
in frosted cards

00:00:27.066 --> 00:00:28.044
where Now Playing

00:00:27.856 --> 00:00:29.199
normally sits under

00:00:29.011 --> 00:00:29.777
the clock

00:00:30.302 --> 00:00:31.717
Plays like musicBack

00:00:31.623 --> 00:00:32.978
forward and pause

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:33.863
between agents

00:00:34.398 --> 00:00:35.412
Full story on

00:00:35.223 --> 00:00:36.119
the dashboard
